  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The strengthening of human rights protection and participation is the third of three outcomes in the Country Programme of UNDP in Lao PDR for the period 2022-2026.In this outcome, the programme seeks to support Lao PDR in meeting the rising public expectations for increased participation and improved governance. This initiation plan will implement activities in the second year of the programme cycle to support development of further pipeline projects under the outputs defined under this outcome</narrative>
  </description>
