   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Key actors have enhanced capacities to strengthen participation of marginalized and vulnerable groups in sustainable development</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The following indicators will measure the number of consultations, trainings and technical level discussions to enhance capacities to strengthen participation of marginalized and vulnerable groups. This includes improving criminal procedure, finalizing Digital Legal Aid FAQs on an online platform, supporting the State on its Human Right&apos;s obligations by consulting on the List of Issues under ICESCR and collect data relating to LGBTQI+ Report at the national and subnational levels.</narrative>
    </description>
